   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Dub · translation (Gemma 3 12B it, bf16)\n\nThe core `TextGenerate` node translates numbered lines; the app builds this graph in `multicam/dub.py` and reads the reply from **Preview Any**. `sampling_mode: off` = greedy, so a re-run gives the same text. Replace the two placeholder lines in the prompt with your own.\n\n| App input | API node.input |\n|---|---|\n| `prompt` | `2.prompt` |\n\n**Nodes in yellow are the ones the app sets on every job** (see `translate_bindings.json`); every other value is exactly what the app submits. Each node keeps its API id in Properties → `api_id`.\n\nThis is a view of `workflows/translate_api.json` (what the app sends to Comfy Cloud). All models are open weights; file names and download links: `workflows/README.md`."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
